         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### The number zero\n\nNowadays, when we talk about a number that represents what we do not have, or emptiness, we use zero (0), but that was not always the case. It may seem strange, but for a long time this concept was not defined.\n\nIn this lesson, we will study this evolution of knowledge and of the need to have a number to represent what we do not have.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
