         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### What is a zero?\n\nThe question may seem strange. People might think it just means not having something, but zero is something much bigger.\n\nAccording to Doctor Auwalu Musa, there is more than one type of zero. In this lesson, we will talk about two of them:\n- Intuitive\n- Numeral\n\nLet's get to know them better.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown/html/text",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
