         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Intuitive\n\nThis is the most common case of zero. It would even be known by ancient peoples who never created a symbol for it.\n\nFor example, if we lower all the fingers of the hand, we will have no raised fingers; therefore, we have zero (0) raised fingers.\n\nThis intuitive zero does not need a symbol to be written. The most important thing here is the idea.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown/html/text",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
