      {
         "id": "03808fad-6362-4083-aef5-76d8e86e5f8b",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "",
         "source_menu": [],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "Since zero (0) is a number that represents \"not having something\", should it be the first of the numbers?",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown/html/text",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "9f4db07e-429e-4f56-b004-2620e34296a4",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": "yes",
         "score": 2,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "9f4db07e-429e-4f56-b004-2620e34296a4",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "",
         "source_menu": [],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Conclusion\n\nIn this lesson, we learned about the number zero. We saw that there is more than one type of zero and that, before different peoples created a symbol for zero, the idea was already present in humanity.\n\nFurthermore, we saw that, since zero carries the idea of \"not having something\", it will be the first among the numbers we will use.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown/html/text",
